_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review18-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　丘巨源，蘭陵蘭陵人也。宋初土斷屬丹陽，後屬蘭陵。巨源少舉丹陽郡孝廉，爲宋孝武所知。大明五人，敕助徐爰撰國史。帝崩，江夏王義恭取爲掌書記。明帝卽位，使參詔誥，引在左右。自南臺御史爲王景文鎮軍參軍，寧喪還家。","reading":"丘巨源自蘭陵經土斷曾屬丹陽。大明五人是固定數位所寫，殿本、四庫本和南史同作五年。之後為義恭掌書記。","note":"丘巨源自蘭陵經土斷曾屬丹陽。大明五人是固定數位所寫，殿本、四庫本和南史同作五年。之後為義恭掌書記。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":104,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review19-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　元徽初，桂陽王休範在尋陽，以巨源有筆翰，遣船迎之，餉以錢物。巨源因太祖自啓，敕板起巨源使留京都。桂陽事起，使於中書省撰符檄，事平，除奉朝請。","reading":"休範遣船迎人，太祖處置令留京；起事時巨源作符檄。","note":"休範遣船迎人，太祖處置令留京；起事時巨源作符檄。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":72,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review20-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　巨源望有封賞，旣而不獲，乃與尚書令袁粲書曰：","reading":"丘巨源向袁粲自陳求賞，下文是書語。","note":"丘巨源向袁粲自陳求賞，下文是書語。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":24,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review21-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　民信理推心，闇於量事，庶謂丹誠感達，賞報孱期；豈虞寂寥，忽焉三稔？議者必云筆記賤伎，非殺活所待；開勸小說，非否判所寄。然則先聲後實，軍國舊章，七德九功，將名當世。仰觀天緯，則右將而左相，俯察人序，則西武而東文，固非胥祝之倫伍，巫匠之流匹矣。","reading":"書首論操筆與武功的異同，保留往來人的自稱民。","note":"書首論操筆與武功的異同，保留往來人的自稱民。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p021","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":122,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review22-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　去昔奇兵，變起呼吸，雖凶渠卽勦，而人情更迷。茅恬開城，千齡出叛，當此之時，心膂胡、越，奉迎新亭者，士庶填路，投名朱雀者，愚智空閨，人惑而民不惑，人畏而民不畏，其一可論也。","reading":"書之一論舉茅恬、千齡，論眾心迷懼。","note":"書之一論舉茅恬、千齡，論眾心迷懼。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p022","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":87,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review23-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　臨機新亭，獨能抽刃斬賊者，唯有張敬兒；而中書省獨能奮筆弗顧者，唯有丘巨源。文武相方，誠有優劣，就其死亡以決成敗，當崩天之敵，抗不測之禍，請問海內，此膽何如？其二可論也。","reading":"書第二論舉斬賊者張敬兒與草書檄者丘巨源。","note":"書第二論舉斬賊者張敬兒與草書檄者丘巨源。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":86,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review24-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　又爾時顛沛，普喚文士，黃門中書，靡不畢集，摛翰振藻，非爲乏人，朝廷洪筆，何故假手凡賤？若以此賊彊盛，勝負難測，羣賢怯不染豪者，則民宜以勇獲賞；若云羽檄之難，必須筆傑，羣賢推能見委者，則民宜以才賜列，其三可論也。","reading":"書第三論問何以用自己操筆，舉勇、才兩端。","note":"書第三論問何以用自己操筆，舉勇、才兩端。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p024","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":107,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review25-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　竊見桂陽賊賞不赦之條凡二十五人，而李恒、鍾爽同在此例，戰敗後出，罪竝釋然，而吳邁遠族誅之。罰則操筆大禍而操戈尤害，論以賞科，則武人超越而文人埋沒，其四可論也。","reading":"書第四論分李恒、鍾爽及吳邁遠的處分。","note":"書第四論分李恒、鍾爽及吳邁遠的處分。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p025","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":81,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review26-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　且邁遠置辭，無乃侵慢，民作符檄，肆言詈辱，放筆出手，卽就兖粉。若使桂陽得志，民若不轘裂軍門，則應腰斬都市，嬰孩脯膾，伊可熟念，其五可論也。","reading":"書第五論以邁遠的辭與自己符檄之險相較。","note":"書第五論以邁遠的辭與自己符檄之險相較。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p026","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":71,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review27-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　往年戎旅，萬有餘甲，十分之中，九分冗隷，可謂衆矣。攀龍附驎，翻焉雲翔。至若民狂夫，可謂寡矣。徒關敕旨，空然泥沈。詎其荷瞂塵末，皆是白起，操牘事始，必非魯連邪？民傎，國算迅足，馳烽旆之機，帝擇逸翰，赴羅之會。旣能陵敵不殿，爭先無負，宜其微賜存在，少沾飲齕。遂乃棄之溝間，如蜉如蟻，擲之言外，如土如灰。絓隷帖戰，無拳無勇，竝隨資峻級矣；凡豫臺內，不文不武，已坐拱清階矣。撫骸如此，瞻例如彼，旣非草木，何能弭聲？","reading":"書末陳功未賞，引白起、魯連作對舉。","note":"書末陳功未賞，引白起、魯連作對舉。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p027","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":205,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review28-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　巨源竟不被申。","reading":"作者求援，終未被申。","note":"作者求援，終未被申。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p028","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":9,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review29-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　歷佐諸王府，轉羽林監。建元元年，爲尚書主客郎，領軍司馬，越騎校尉。除武昌太守，拜竟，不樂江外行，世祖問之，巨源曰：「古人云：『寧飲建業水，不食武昌魚。』臣年已老，寧死於建業。」以爲餘杭令。","reading":"武昌太守已拜而未樂行，改餘杭令。寧死於建業是對語。","note":"武昌太守已拜而未樂行，改餘杭令。寧死於建業是對語。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":96,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review30-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"　　沈攸之事，太祖使巨源爲尚書符荊州，巨源以此又望賞異，自此意常不滿。高宗爲吳興，巨源作《秋胡詩》，有譏刺語，以事見殺。","reading":"前追沈攸之事，後述高宗任吳興及以《秋胡詩》見殺，無卒年。","note":"前追沈攸之事，後述高宗任吳興及以《秋胡詩》見殺，無卒年。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":60,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:variant_review18-43","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","source_quote":"大明五人","reading":"武英殿本及四庫本作「大明五年」，《南史》同。所據數位作「大明五人」。","note":"武英殿本及四庫本作「大明五年」，《南史》同。所據數位作「大明五人」。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018","start_codepoint":43,"end_codepoint":47,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi052-juyuan-death","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","event_type":"death","source_term":"見殺","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"見殺"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","quote":"　　沈攸之事，太祖使巨源爲尚書符荊州，巨源以此又望賞異，自此意常不滿。高宗爲吳興，巨源作《秋胡詩》，有譏刺語，以事見殺。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0010"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"丘巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023:m0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"丘巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p028:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p028","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p001:m0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"丘巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018","text":"　　丘巨源，蘭陵蘭陵人也。宋初土斷屬丹陽，後屬蘭陵。巨源少舉丹陽郡孝廉，爲宋孝武所知。大明五人，敕助徐爰撰國史。帝崩，江夏王義恭取爲掌書記。明帝卽位，使參詔誥，引在左右。自南臺御史爲王景文鎮軍參軍，寧喪還家。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":49,"last_line":49,"raw_start":2406,"raw_end":2510,"raw_character_offsets":[2406,2407,2408,2409,2410,2411,2412,2413,2414,2415,2416,2417,2418,2419,2420,2421,2422,2423,2424,2425,2426,2427,2428,2429,2430,2431,2432,2433,2434,2435,2436,2437,2438,2439,2440,2441,2442,2443,2444,2445,2446,2447,2448,2449,2450,2451,2452,2453,2454,2455,2456,2457,2458,2459,2460,2461,2462,2463,2464,2465,2466,2467,2468,2469,2470,2471,2472,2473,2474,2475,2476,2477,2478,2479,2480,2481,2482,2483,2484,2485,2486,2487,2488,2489,2490,2491,2492,2493,2494,2495,2496,2497,2498,2499,2500,2501,2502,2503,2504,2505,2506,2507,2508,2509],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"丘巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"宋孝武","kind":"person","person_id":"hx8_st4_jdd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"徐爰","kind":"person","person_id":"rq3_n56_efd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0059","start":59,"end":64,"surface":"江夏王義恭","kind":"person","person_id":"2n6_7xk_5ov","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p018:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019","text":"　　元徽初，桂陽王休範在尋陽，以巨源有筆翰，遣船迎之，餉以錢物。巨源因太祖自啓，敕板起巨源使留京都。桂陽事起，使於中書省撰符檄，事平，除奉朝請。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":51,"last_line":51,"raw_start":2512,"raw_end":2584,"raw_character_offsets":[2512,2513,2514,2515,2516,2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523,2524,2525,2526,2527,2528,2529,2530,2531,2532,2533,2534,2535,2536,2537,2538,2539,2540,2541,2542,2543,2544,2545,2546,2547,2548,2549,2550,2551,2552,2553,2554,2555,2556,2557,2558,2559,2560,2561,2562,2563,2564,2565,2566,2567,2568,2569,2570,2571,2572,2573,2574,2575,2576,2577,2578,2579,2580,2581,2582,2583],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"桂陽王休範","kind":"person","person_id":"fjv_3dz_w0m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p019:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020","text":"　　巨源望有封賞，旣而不獲，乃與尚書令袁粲書曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":53,"last_line":53,"raw_start":2586,"raw_end":2610,"raw_character_offsets":[2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p020:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"袁粲","kind":"person","person_id":"ez7_i28_72u","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023","text":"　　臨機新亭，獨能抽刃斬賊者，唯有張敬兒；而中書省獨能奮筆弗顧者，唯有丘巨源。文武相方，誠有優劣，就其死亡以決成敗，當崩天之敵，抗不測之禍，請問海內，此膽何如？其二可論也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":59,"last_line":59,"raw_start":2827,"raw_end":2914,"raw_character_offsets":[2828,2829,2830,2831,2832,2833,2834,2835,2836,2837,2838,2839,2840,2841,2842,2843,2844,2845,2846,2847,2848,2849,2850,2851,2852,2853,2854,2855,2856,2857,2858,2859,2860,2861,2862,2863,2864,2865,2866,2867,2868,2869,2870,2871,2872,2873,2874,2875,2876,2877,2878,2879,2880,2881,2882,2883,2884,2885,2886,2887,2888,2889,2890,2891,2892,2893,2894,2895,2896,2897,2898,2899,2900,2901,2902,2903,2904,2905,2906,2907,2908,2909,2910,2911,2912,2913],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"張敬兒","kind":"person","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p023:m0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"丘巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p028","text":"　　巨源竟不被申。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":69,"last_line":69,"raw_start":3392,"raw_end":3401,"raw_character_offsets":[3392,3393,3394,3395,3396,3397,3398,3399,3400],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p028:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029","text":"　　歷佐諸王府，轉羽林監。建元元年，爲尚書主客郎，領軍司馬，越騎校尉。除武昌太守，拜竟，不樂江外行，世祖問之，巨源曰：「古人云：『寧飲建業水，不食武昌魚。』臣年已老，寧死於建業。」以爲餘杭令。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":71,"last_line":71,"raw_start":3403,"raw_end":3499,"raw_character_offsets":[3403,3404,3405,3406,3407,3408,3409,3410,3411,3412,3413,3414,3415,3416,3417,3418,3419,3420,3421,3422,3423,3424,3425,3426,3427,3428,3429,3430,3431,3432,3433,3434,3435,3436,3437,3438,3439,3440,3441,3442,3443,3444,3445,3446,3447,3448,3449,3450,3451,3452,3453,3454,3455,3456,3457,3458,3459,3460,3461,3462,3463,3464,3465,3466,3467,3468,3469,3470,3471,3472,3473,3474,3475,3476,3477,3478,3479,3480,3481,3482,3483,3484,3485,3486,3487,3488,3489,3490,3491,3492,3493,3494,3495,3496,3497,3498],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p029:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030","text":"　　沈攸之事，太祖使巨源爲尚書符荊州，巨源以此又望賞異，自此意常不滿。高宗爲吳興，巨源作《秋胡詩》，有譏刺語，以事見殺。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":73,"last_line":73,"raw_start":3501,"raw_end":3561,"raw_character_offsets":[3501,3502,3503,3504,3505,3506,3507,3508,3509,3510,3511,3512,3513,3514,3515,3516,3517,3518,3519,3520,3521,3522,3523,3524,3525,3526,3527,3528,3529,3530,3531,3532,3533,3534,3535,3536,3537,3538,3539,3540,3541,3542,3543,3544,3545,3546,3547,3548,3549,3550,3551,3552,3553,3554,3555,3556,3557,3558,3559,3560],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"高宗","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p030:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"巨源","kind":"person","person_id":"efz_le3_dxz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p001","text":"　　王智深字雲才，琅邪臨沂人也。少從陳郡謝超宗學屬文。好飲酒，拙澀乏風儀。宋建平王景素爲南徐州，作《觀法篇》，智深和之，見賞，辟爲西曹書佐。貧無衣，未到職而景素敗。後解褐爲州祭酒。太祖爲鎮軍時，丘巨源薦之於太祖，板爲府行參軍，除豫章王國常侍，遷太學博士，豫章王大司馬參軍，兼記室。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"raw_start":3571,"raw_end":3711,"raw_character_offsets":[3571,3572,3573,3574,3575,3576,3577,3578,3579,3580,3581,3582,3583,3584,3585,3586,3587,3588,3589,3590,3591,3592,3593,3594,3595,3596,3597,3598,3599,3600,3601,3602,3603,3604,3605,3606,3607,3608,3609,3610,3611,3612,3613,3614,3615,3616,3617,3618,3619,3620,3621,3622,3623,3624,3625,3626,3627,3628,3629,3630,3631,3632,3633,3634,3635,3636,3637,3638,3639,3640,3641,3642,3643,3644,3645,3646,3647,3648,3649,3650,3651,3652,3653,3654,3655,3656,3657,3658,3659,3660,3661,3662,3663,3664,3665,3666,3667,3668,3669,3670,3671,3672,3673,3674,3675,3676,3677,3678,3679,3680,3681,3682,3683,3684,3685,3686,3687,3688,3689,3690,3691,3692,3693,3694,3695,3696,3697,3698,3699,3700,3701,3702,3703,3704,3705,3706,3707,3708,3709,3710],"revision_i